HANDOFF:
  next_bar 35, E-flat major (from the G-major chord), meter 4/4, T=50.
  At the seam: a G-major chord pp with fermata (cb g1, vc g2, va g3,
  vn2 b3+d4, cl d4, vn1 d5) - the dominant of C minor.  It is NOT
  resolved: the G becomes the third of E-flat, and the brass chorale
  begins on g4 (horn 1) - the first sound of the trombones.
